# F2: Meeting, built with petforge. One prompt per line; each plugin command counts as one prompt.
# Same shape and weight as F1 (Contract): a bounded text, an enum, a required and an optional
# timestamp, an optional text, a defaulted bool and one cross-field rule.
/petforge:slice-plan Meeting in a new context governance (board meetings and their decisions): title text 1..200 chars; kind enum REGULAR or EXTRAORDINARY, default REGULAR; held_at timestamptz required; ends_at timestamptz optional; location text up to 200 chars, optional; quorum_required bool, default true. Rule: ends_at, when set, is after held_at.
/petforge:slice-scaffold
/petforge:slice-tests
/petforge:slice-ship
